  "HDDS-11649": {
    "jira_id": "HDDS-11649",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Recon ListKeys API: Simplify filter predicates",
    "description": "In the Recon ListKeys API, a series of predicate lambdas are created to filter the returned keys. The filters create 3 new lambdas for each key to check and this api could iterate a lot of keys in parallel.\r\n\r\nBenchmarking the original code against simple IF statements shows the IF statements to be about 3x faster. However the creation of all the lambda object resulted in about 4500MB/s of short lived objects.\r\n\r\nThis PR simplifies the code to IF statements. It should not change any functionality.",
